1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,002
That swamp you'll fly over in GTA 6?

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:08,989
It's based on the Everglades, and the real one once swallowed a passenger jet.

3
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:12,055
May 11th, 1996.

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:19,874
ValuJet Flight 592 takes off from Miami, heading for Atlanta with 110 people on board.

5
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,887
Minutes later, the crew reports smoke.

6
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:25,010
They try to turn back.

7
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,880
They never make it.

8
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,720
[SILENCE]

9
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:32,458
The plane dives into the Everglades at high speed.

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,748
Rescuers arrive to find almost nothing.

11
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,570
No big pieces of wreckage.

12
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,555
No survivors.

13
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:44,676
Just jet fuel floating on the water between the sawgrass.

14
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,737
The plane had disappeared into the mud.

15
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:55,320
Investigators later traced the fire to oxygen generators that should never have been loaded into the cargo hold.

16
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:59,890
Follow for more of the real places behind GTA 6.
